<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><%- include('../partials/head') %></head>
<body>
<%- include('../partials/navbar') %>
<%- include('../partials/flash') %>

<section class="hero-section" style="padding: 70px 0;">
  <div class="container text-center">
    <h1 class="font-display">About Podify</h1>
    <p class="lead mx-auto" style="max-width:640px;">We built Podify so anyone can turn a blank product into something personal — no design experience required.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="container section-pad">
  <div class="row g-5 align-items-center">
    <div class="col-lg-6">
      <span class="section-eyebrow">Our Story</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">From idea to printed product, in minutes</h2>
      <p class="text-muted mt-3">Podify started with a simple observation: printing on everyday objects — bottles, mugs, apparel — always meant guessing at price and hoping the design would look right. We fixed both problems with live preview and a transparent, size-and-material based pricing engine.</p>
      <p class="text-muted">Our marketplace connects independent vendors with customers who want something truly their own — while giving vendors the tools to manage products, orders, and designs from one dashboard.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="col-lg-6">
      <div class="row g-3">
        <div class="col-6"><div class="pd-card p-4 text-center"><i class="bi bi-palette2 fs-1 text-gradient"></i><h6 class="mt-3">Live Customization</h6></div></div>
        <div class="col-6"><div class="pd-card p-4 text-center"><i class="bi bi-calculator fs-1 text-gradient"></i><h6 class="mt-3">Instant Pricing</h6></div></div>
        <div class="col-6"><div class="pd-card p-4 text-center"><i class="bi bi-shop fs-1 text-gradient"></i><h6 class="mt-3">Vendor Marketplace</h6></div></div>
        <div class="col-6"><div class="pd-card p-4 text-center"><i class="bi bi-truck fs-1 text-gradient"></i><h6 class="mt-3">Order Tracking</h6></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
<%- include('../partials/scripts') %>
</body>
</html>
